Value TIMESTAMP ([A-Z][a-z]{2}\s+\d+\s+\d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2}(?:\.\d+)?)
Value HOST (\S+)
Value PROCESS ([\w./-]+)
Value EVENT ([A-Z][A-Z0-9_]+)
Value MESSAGE (.*)

# Junos:  Nov 23 10:15:01  leaf-04 mib2d[2211]: SNMP_TRAP_LINK_DOWN: ifIndex 512, ifAdminStatus up(1), ifOperStatus down(2), ifName et-0/0/48
Start
  ^${TIMESTAMP}\s+${HOST}\s+${PROCESS}(?:\[\d+\])?:\s+${EVENT}:\s+${MESSAGE} -> Record
  ^.* -> Next
